  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Really love the idea\nhere is your time devs to actually add some features I would pay for. \nA follow system - follow your fav avatar creator/world creator. to get their newest public avatar or get notified on their new world, if they enable it to be used for people. \nchatting system - by far one of the best features I would love to see. The ability to text people over vrchat, is such a cool concept. you could send message to vrc plus users. if the person allows messages from other users of course.\nfeedback on worlds and avatars+ a feature where vrc plus users can leave a rating on the world they like. and it will be shown if you have vrc plus. or an avatar if it needs fixing\nMarker+ for VRC plus users\na marker that can be used natively by vrchat users. and everyone could see, you can also erase it.\nthose are some features which I think would make the subscription worth it",
